<title>HONG KONG: National Elec buys HK$110 mln property.</title>
<headline>National Elec buys HK$110 mln property.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Electronics Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it had agreed to buy a property in Stanley Village Road in Hong Kong for HK$110 million and the purchase would be funded by its owns resources and bank borrowings.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase would not have any adverse effect on its gearing or working capital position.</p>
<p>The property comprises two separate three storey town house residences and the company will retain the property for investment purposes, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
